  "description": "Can men and women be friends? YES or NO?\n\nGu Do-eun, collector of duds.\nThe boyfriend she trusted got caught rolling around in bed with another woman, leading to their breakup. \n\nTo make matters worse, her flat renovation coincided, leaving her with nowhere to stay! In the midst of her mental breakdown, childhood friend Han-ju proposes they live together...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/namnyeochilse), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/namnyeochilse) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/men-and-women-dont-sit-together-at-seven/list?title_no=10804), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/men-and-women-dont-sit-together-at-seven/list?title_no=10671), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/roommates/list?title_no=10902)",
